<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle: 'Privacy Policy | XOLUTIONS HUB', pageDescription: 'Privacy Policy for XOLUTIONS HUB.' }) %></head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="page">
    <div class="wrap prose">
<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>When you place an order, we collect your name, email address, phone number, institution, project details, and any documents you choose to upload. Payment is by bank transfer, so we never collect card details. If you send us a payment receipt on WhatsApp, we use it only to verify your payment.</p>

    <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>We use your information solely to process and fulfil your order, communicate with you about its status, and provide support. We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

    <h2>3. Document Storage</h2>
    <p>Uploaded documents are stored securely and are only accessible to you (via your logged-in dashboard) and authorised XOLUTIONS HUB staff.</p>

    <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain order and account information for as long as needed to provide our services and meet reasonable record-keeping needs.</p>

    <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
    <p>You can request a copy of the information we hold about you, or request deletion of your account and data, by contacting us at <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a>.</p>

    <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>We use WhatsApp to receive payment receipts and messages, and Gmail for transactional email. These providers have their own privacy policies governing the data they process on our behalf.</p>

    <h2>7. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href="mailto:<%= site.email %>"><%= site.email %></a> or WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/<%= site.whatsappIntl %>"><%= site.whatsappDisplay %></a>.</p>

    <p class="fine">This is a baseline privacy policy intended as a starting point. We recommend formal legal review before relying on it for compliance purposes.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
